practice_explanation = "range(4) gives the numbers 0, 1, 2, 3 — that's 4 values. So the loop body runs 4 times. Common mistake: thinking range(4) means 1 to 4 (which would be 4 values too, but they're 1, 2, 3, 4 — different numbers)."
